WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
A small boat follows the quiet harbor.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
The moon rests above the water.

00:09.500 --> 00:11.500
The boat carries on toward home.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.000
The shoreline draws closer.

00:16.500 --> 00:20.000
A quiet journey through the harbor.
